\n\n|  | Test point | $x$ | $(2-y)$ | $f(x,y)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Top-Left | $(-1,3)$ | $-$ | $-$ | $+$ |\n| Top-Right | $(1,3)$ | $+$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Left | $(-1,1)$ | $-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Right | $(1,1)$ | $+$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n\n \n\nFinally, on our diagram, we shade in the solutions to $f(x,y)>0$ using the *last* column of the table above.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14041262/assets/9710358526e0e14fbf7263ba5d1496cdcb2941f9cb32a1d07b2ea37865163ab2.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14041262/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff63683317b1ff68128f81c27594160ddb5912a52e3945dd03e8f649d0905b33"} {"question" "q-149553" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14041262/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b8535935689f512014d69f4f37d9eb2fb99191853e23ef5af94320df3ebeec9a"} {"question" "q-149553" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14041262/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff63683317b1ff68128f81c27594160ddb5912a52e3945dd03e8f649d0905b33"} {"question" "q-149553" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14041262/assets/02a01c1a57b61374e7f9c44b7609f7c0b48c9f91a44ffd0d4a86afeb0909ed68.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14041262/assets/330f6080a3640f193e3d1650405030c049f059aaa9e3c6f280d2355382ed2e69.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_A